					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1243.222,
							276.828,
							9382.064
						],
						"pointId": 9800
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1245.777,
							277.26,
							9383.85
						],
						"pointId": 9801
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750180301,
					"content": "\"Shwrawr!\"\\nAs if knowing it is outmatched, the Qucusaurus flies off with a cry...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180302
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750180302,
					"content": "Argh, it's quick! Gone in the blink of an eye!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180303,
						750180305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180303,
					"content": "C'mon, Paimon, after it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180304
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750180304,
					"content": "Wha— You want Paimon to go chase it? Seriously?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180307,
					"content": "...Hmm, if nothing else, it does look like it's recovered quite nicely. Next, we should...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180308,
					"content": "Speaking of which, why was that Qucusaurus so mad?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180309,
					"content": "...Hmm, Paimon knows! You must've stolen its snacks! There's nothing more infuriating than a food thief, Paimon'll tell ya that!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180310,
					"content": "Snacks? Well, yes, I've had some, but Kururuk's not the type to get in a huff over small stuff like that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180311,
					"content": "\"Kururuk\"? So it has a name... Seems like it's got quite a temper on it, though! Almost hit you back there!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180312,
					"content": "Well, I wouldn't blame him, the treatment being what it is...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180313,
					"content": "So taking a beating is also a kind of healing? You learn something every day...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180314
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750180314,
					"content": "Rawr! Raaaawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180315,
					"content": "#What? Come on, how did you get that into your head? Cut that nonsense out right now — you're giving {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} the wrong idea!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180316,
					"content": "Hroowr? Rrooh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180317,
					"content": "Haha, if that was a workable form of therapy, I'd love to try it myself! Unfortunately, Saurians are different from us. Even if you told them something would help them recover quickly, there's no guarantee they'd understand.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180318,
					"content": "Ah, yes, allow me to introduce myself. I'm Mazkal. I usually take care of wounded or sick Saurians nearby. Not to brag or anything, but my medicines get pretty good client reviews.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180319,
					"content": "Hmm. Your little companion looks very healthy. Doesn't look like he needs my help.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180320,
					"content": "Rawr! Raaaawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180321,
					"content": "Ah, so you're a Saurian vet! Uhh, judging from the way Kururuk behaved, seems like a pretty tough job...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180322,
					"content": "Oh, I wouldn't say it's all that tough. It's just that Kururuk's case is somewhat... special. He's deeply distrustful of humans right now, so he resists all treatments and medication.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180323,
					"content": "*sigh* If only I were a Saurian myself. I've observed him, and he gets along with other Saurians just fine. Perhaps he'd be willing to take medicine if it came recommended by another Saurian.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180324,
					"content": "Wroo?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180325,
					"content": "Hmm, well if that's the case, we might just be able to help you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180326,
					"content": "Huh? Wait, you're saying that despite your appearance, you're actually Saurians!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180327,
					"content": "You sure have an overactive imagination! Ugh...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180328,
					"content": "#A—Anyway, the real reason we can do this is because {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}'s a super clever little Saurian! He can help us out!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180329,
					"content": "Huh? He's that smart?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180330,
						750180332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180330,
					"content": "Got a good eye for picking me as a companion, if nothing else...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180331
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750180331,
					"content": "Uh, sure, but that's not really the focus right now, is it?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180333,
					"content": "#Yup! Either way, you can leave this to {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}, no problem!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180334,
					"content": "Rawr! Rawr!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180335,
					"content": "#Then on Kururuk's behalf, let me thank you in advance, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180336,
					"content": "I've been worried that if he keeps acting up like this, it might not only prevent his old injuries from healing, but even cause new wounds to emerge... So I'm most relieved to have your help!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180337,
					"content": "I've formulated two different medicines for him. I've done my best to balance therapeutic effects and palatability, but I haven't come up with the perfect solution by any means...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180338
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180338,
					"content": "The result being that the more effective of the two medicines isn't as tasty, while the one Saurians love isn't quite as effective...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180339
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180339,
					"content": "#Hmm... Well, instead of all this explaining, let's just have {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} take a sniff. You'll get the picture from how he reacts.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180340
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180340,
					"content": "Here's the more effective medicine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180341
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
